{"about_the_game":"The director's body was found in the office. At first glance it looks like suicide. But the experienced detective begins to investigate.<br>The genre of the game is a walking simulator with a third-person or first-person view (you can switch with the mouse wheel). You will need to complete various tasks to get closer to catching the murderer. Although the game is about a murder investigation but it will also have funny moments. It will be possible to explore area, communicate with various characters, watch interesting cut scenes. There will be several locations in the game.<br>Game controls:<br><strong>WASD </strong>- move<br><strong>E </strong>- activate<br><strong>Space bar</strong>- jump<br><strong>C </strong>- crouch<br><strong>Left Shift</strong> - walk/run<br><strong>Mouse wheel</strong> - zoom<br><strong>Tab</strong> - show/hide task","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1893210?t=1673957877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1673957877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1673957877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1673957877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"A corpse in the form of a toy, talking about sex"},"detailed_description":"The director's body was found in the office. At first glance it looks like suicide. But the experienced detective begins to investigate.<br>The genre of the game is a walking simulator with a third-person or first-person view (you can switch with the mouse wheel). You will need to complete various tasks to get closer to catching the murderer. Although the game is about a murder investigation but it will also have funny moments. It